---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Pull vs push';
const subtitle = 'You are the team lead. Two ways the same migration shows up in your week.';
---
<Base title={title} description={subtitle}>
  <article class="etude-page">
    <header class="etude-head">
      <p class="etude-kicker">Etude · The anti-cascader</p>
      <h1 class="etude-title">{title}</h1>
      <p class="etude-relief">{subtitle}</p>
      <nav class="etude-nav">
        <a href="/etudes/anti-cascader/">← anti-cascader etudes</a>
        <span class="etude-nav-sep">·</span>
        <a href="/puzzles/bob-the-fixer-as-anti-cascader/">essay</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="etude-intro">
      <p>You lead a Java service team. Eight engineers, your own roadmap, your own oncall. The platform team's "Spring Boot 3 migration" is on the company-wide tracker.</p>
      <p>It can show up in your week one of two ways. Walk through both.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="etude-stage">
      <div class="role-toggle" role="tablist">
        <button type="button" class="role-btn role-btn-active" data-role="push" role="tab" aria-selected="true">
          <span class="role-name">Scenario A · operator-pushed PR</span>
          <span class="role-meta">platform team opens it at you</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="role-btn" data-role="pull" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
          <span class="role-name">Scenario B · team-installed skill</span>
          <span class="role-meta">your engineer invokes it</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div id="day" class="day-stage" aria-live="polite"></div>

      <div id="cmp-card" class="etude-card cmp-card" hidden>
        <p class="etude-step">Side-by-side</p>
        <div class="cmp-grid">
          <div class="cmp-col">
            <p class="cmp-col-name">Scenario A · push</p>
            <ul class="cmp-list">
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Trigger</span><span class="cmp-v">Platform team's deadline</span></li>
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Author</span><span class="cmp-v">Bot account, no in-team context</span></li>
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Cognitive load</span><span class="cmp-v">High — context-acquisition by reviewer</span></li>
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Risk owner</span><span class="cmp-v">Whoever clicks merge</span></li>
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Pacing</span><span class="cmp-v">Externally imposed</span></li>
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Outcome at month 6</span><span class="cmp-v cmp-bad">Half-merged, long tail, escalation</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="cmp-col">
            <p class="cmp-col-name">Scenario B · pull</p>
            <ul class="cmp-list">
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Trigger</span><span class="cmp-v">Your engineer's clock</span></li>
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Author</span><span class="cmp-v">Your engineer (with bob's help)</span></li>
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Cognitive load</span><span class="cmp-v">Low — explanation arrives with diff</span></li>
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Risk owner</span><span class="cmp-v">The team that wrote the code</span></li>
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Pacing</span><span class="cmp-v">Team's own clock</span></li>
              <li><span class="cmp-k">Outcome at month 6</span><span class="cmp-v cmp-good">Done; team learned the migration</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="cmp-note">The diff is identical. The codemod is identical. Only the load-bearing arrow flipped.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="etude-failure">
      <h2 class="etude-failure-title">Why pull works</h2>
      <p>Push fails because the team that owns the code didn't author the change. They don't trust the diff and they can't pace it. The PR sits in the queue with no one whose job it is to push it through.</p>
      <p>Pull works because the team is the agent. The team's engineer ran the codemod, watched the diff, ran the tests, opened the PR. The merge confidence is first-person. <strong>That confidence is what closes the long tail.</strong></p>
    </section>

    <footer class="etude-coda">
      <p>Same code, same migration. The flipped arrow is the work.</p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Base>

<script is:inline>
  // Two scenarios, same migration, different week. The reader walks through
  // each as a sequence of events; the day's mood ribbon and cognitive-load
  // bar update as events accrue. After both scenarios are walked, the
  // side-by-side comparison card unlocks.

  const PUSH = {
    weekDays: [
      { day: 'Mon', time: '9:14 AM', kind: 'event', icon: '✉', text: '<strong>@platform-bot</strong> opens PR <code>migrate-sb3-step-02</code> against your service. Description: "automated migration to Spring Boot 3."', delta: { mood: -1, load: 2 } },
      { day: 'Mon', time: '10:42 AM', kind: 'event', icon: '?', text: 'You skim the diff. 2 files changed, 20 lines. You do not know who wrote the codemod. You do not know what step 02 of how-many is. The branch name implies others are coming.', delta: { mood: -1, load: 2 } },
      { day: 'Mon', time: '2:30 PM', kind: 'thought', icon: '·', text: '<em>"Is this safe?"</em> No tests added. No issue linked. The PR description is a label.', delta: { mood: -1, load: 1 } },
      { day: 'Wed', time: '11:00 AM', kind: 'event', icon: '⏱', text: 'PR has been open 48 hours. You have not merged it. Your team has shipped two of their own PRs in that window.', delta: { mood: 0, load: 1 } },
      { day: 'Thu', time: '4:55 PM', kind: 'event', icon: '⚠', text: '<strong>@platform-bot</strong> comments: "Friendly nudge — please review by EOW. Tracking on the migration dashboard."', delta: { mood: -2, load: 1 } },
      { day: 'Fri', time: '5:50 PM', kind: 'thought', icon: '·', text: '<em>"It compiles. Tests pass. Whatever."</em> You click merge. You have spent 35 minutes total reading a 20-line PR.', delta: { mood: -1, load: -3 } },
      { day: 'Wk2', time: '—', kind: 'event', icon: '↻', text: '<strong>@platform-bot</strong> opens step 03. Then step 04. Then step 05.', delta: { mood: -1, load: 2 } },
      { day: 'M6', time: '—', kind: 'event', icon: '✗', text: 'Migration dashboard says 87%. Your service is in the long tail because step 06 sat for ten weeks. The platform team is about to launch a tracking initiative.', delta: { mood: -1, load: 0 } }
    ],
    final: 'Migration "complete." Long tail. Trust between teams a little worse. Your team learned nothing.'
  };

  const PULL = {
    weekDays: [
      { day: 'Mon', time: '10:00 AM', kind: 'event', icon: '+', text: 'Sprint planning. <strong>@kanika</strong> raises Spring Boot 3 in the company tracker. The team agrees: <em>now</em>, not Q4. She installs <code>bob-the-fixer</code>.', delta: { mood: 1, load: 1 } },
      { day: 'Tue', time: '11:30 AM', kind: 'event', icon: '▶', text: '<strong>@kanika</strong> types <code>/migrate-spring-boot-3</code> in the repo. Bob runs the precheck — tests green, repo clean — and prints the explanation for step 02.', delta: { mood: 1, load: 1 } },
      { day: 'Tue', time: '11:34 AM', kind: 'thought', icon: '·', text: '<em>"javax → jakarta. Mechanical, byte-deterministic. AST pattern is unambiguous."</em> She reads the explanation in 90 seconds and runs the codemod.', delta: { mood: 1, load: -1 } },
      { day: 'Tue', time: '11:40 AM', kind: 'event', icon: '✓', text: 'Tests run. 142 pass. <strong>@kanika</strong> opens a 14-line PR titled "step 02 — javax→jakarta imports." Her name on it. She tags you.', delta: { mood: 1, load: 1 } },
      { day: 'Tue', time: '2:15 PM', kind: 'event', icon: '✓', text: 'You review. The diff is mechanical. <strong>@kanika</strong> wrote the description and linked the explanation she ran through. You approve in three minutes.', delta: { mood: 1, load: -2 } },
      { day: 'Wk2', time: '—', kind: 'event', icon: '▶', text: '<strong>@dev2</strong> picks up step 03 next sprint. Same shape — explanation, codemod, diff, PR, stop. Same review confidence.', delta: { mood: 1, load: 0 } },
      { day: 'Wk5', time: '—', kind: 'event', icon: '✓', text: 'All 7 steps merged. Total reviewer time: ~25 minutes across the migration. <strong>@kanika</strong> understands the Spring Boot 3 namespace shift and the Jakarta EE move.', delta: { mood: 1, load: -1 } },
      { day: 'M6', time: '—', kind: 'event', icon: '✓', text: 'Next migration ships. <strong>@kanika</strong> moves through it faster — she has the model now. The platform team did not open a single PR against your service.', delta: { mood: 1, load: 0 } }
    ],
    final: 'Migration done. Team learned the change. Trust between teams unchanged or better. Next migration is faster.'
  };

  const SCENARIOS = { push: PUSH, pull: PULL };

  const stage = document.getElementById('day');
  const cmpCard = document.getElementById('cmp-card');
  const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.role-btn');

  let current = 'push';
  let visited = { push: false, pull: false };

  function render(role) {
    current = role;
    buttons.forEach(b => {
      const on = b.dataset.role === role;
      b.classList.toggle('role-btn-active', on);
      b.setAttribute('aria-selected', on ? 'true' : 'false');
    });

    const s = SCENARIOS[role];
    stage.innerHTML = `
      <div class="day-card">
        <div class="day-meters">
          <div class="meter">
            <span class="meter-label">Mood</span>
            <span class="meter-track"><span class="meter-fill meter-fill-mood" id="mood-fill"></span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="meter">
            <span class="meter-label">Cognitive load</span>
            <span class="meter-track"><span class="meter-fill meter-fill-load" id="load-fill"></span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ol class="day-feed" id="feed"></ol>
        <div class="day-controls">
          <button type="button" id="advance" class="etude-next">Next event</button>
          <button type="button" id="rewind" class="etude-ghost">Rewind</button>
        </div>
        <div class="day-final" id="day-final" hidden></div>
      </div>
    `;

    let mood = role === 'push' ? 0 : 0;
    let load = 0;
    let idx = 0;
    const feed = document.getElementById('feed');
    const advance = document.getElementById('advance');
    const rewind = document.getElementById('rewind');
    const finalEl = document.getElementById('day-final');
    const moodFill = document.getElementById('mood-fill');
    const loadFill = document.getElementById('load-fill');

    function updateMeters() {
      const moodPct = Math.max(5, Math.min(95, 50 + mood * 8));
      const loadPct = Math.max(5, Math.min(95, 20 + load * 9));
      moodFill.style.width = moodPct + '%';
      moodFill.classList.toggle('mood-good', mood > 1);
      moodFill.classList.toggle('mood-bad', mood < -1);
      loadFill.style.width = loadPct + '%';
      loadFill.classList.toggle('load-bad', load > 4);
      loadFill.classList.toggle('load-warn', load > 2 && load <= 4);
    }

    function step() {
      if (idx >= s.weekDays.length) return;
      const ev = s.weekDays[idx];
      mood = Math.max(-6, Math.min(6, mood + (ev.delta.mood || 0)));
      load = Math.max(0, Math.min(8, load + (ev.delta.load || 0)));
      const li = document.createElement('li');
      li.className = `feed-item feed-item-${ev.kind}`;
      li.innerHTML = `
        <span class="feed-when"><span class="feed-day">${ev.day}</span><span class="feed-time">${ev.time}</span></span>
        <span class="feed-icon">${ev.icon}</span>
        <span class="feed-text">${ev.text}</span>
      `;
      feed.appendChild(li);
      requestAnimationFrame(() => li.classList.add('feed-item-visible'));
      idx += 1;
      updateMeters();

      if (idx >= s.weekDays.length) {
        advance.disabled = true;
        finalEl.hidden = false;
        finalEl.innerHTML = `<p class="day-final-text">${s.final}</p>`;
        visited[role] = true;
        if (visited.push && visited.pull) {
          cmpCard.hidden = false;
          cmpCard.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });
        } else {
          finalEl.innerHTML += `<p class="day-final-prompt">${role === 'push' ? 'Switch to scenario B to see how the same migration runs as pull.' : 'Switch to scenario A if you skipped it.'}</p>`;
        }
      }
    }

    advance.addEventListener('click', step);
    rewind.addEventListener('click', () => {
      idx = 0;
      mood = 0; load = 0;
      feed.innerHTML = '';
      finalEl.hidden = true;
      finalEl.innerHTML = '';
      advance.disabled = false;
      updateMeters();
    });

    updateMeters();
  }

  buttons.forEach(b => {
    b.addEventListener('click', () => render(b.dataset.role));
  });
  render('push');
</script>

<style is:global>
  .etude-page { max-width: 38rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; }
  .etude-head { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .etude-kicker {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: var(--label-size);
    letter-spacing: var(--label-tracking);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .etude-title { font-family: var(--serif-display); font-size: 2.25rem; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .etude-relief { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 1rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  .etude-nav { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .etude-nav a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }
  .etude-nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .etude-nav-sep { margin: 0 0.5rem; opacity: 0.5; }

  .etude-intro { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .etude-intro p { margin: 0 0 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .etude-stage { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2rem; }

  .etude-card {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .etude-step {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: var(--label-size);
    letter-spacing: var(--label-tracking);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  /* === toggle === */
  .role-toggle {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .role-btn {
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
    text-align: left;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--text);
    transition: border-color 180ms ease, background 180ms ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }
  .role-btn:hover:not(.role-btn-active) { border-color: var(--muted); }
  .role-btn-active { border-color: var(--accent); background: rgba(138, 52, 32, 0.05); }
  .role-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .role-meta { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }

  /* === day stage === */
  .day-stage { margin: 0; }
  .day-card {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.4rem 1.2rem;
  }

  .day-meters {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
  }
  .meter { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.3rem; }
  .meter-label {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .meter-track {
    display: block;
    height: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--line);
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .meter-fill {
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
    width: 50%;
    background: var(--muted);
    transition: width 320ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), background 240ms ease;
  }
  .meter-fill-mood { background: #b87333; }
  .meter-fill-mood.mood-good { background: #2d7a3e; }
  .meter-fill-mood.mood-bad  { background: var(--accent); }
  .meter-fill-load { background: #2d7a3e; width: 20%; }
  .meter-fill-load.load-warn { background: #d99a4a; }
  .meter-fill-load.load-bad  { background: var(--accent); }

  /* === feed === */
  .day-feed {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0; margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .feed-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4.5rem 1.2rem 1fr;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(6px);
    transition: opacity 280ms ease, transform 280ms ease;
  }
  .feed-item-visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .feed-item-thought {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .feed-when {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .feed-day {
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .feed-time { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .feed-icon {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .feed-text { line-height: 1.55; }
  .feed-text code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    padding: 0.05rem 0.32rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  /* === controls === */
  .day-controls {
    display: flex; gap: 0.55rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
  }
  .etude-next {
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.15rem; min-height: 40px;
    border: none; background: var(--text); color: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 180ms ease, opacity 180ms ease;
  }
  .etude-next:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--accent); }
  .etude-next:disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .etude-ghost {
    appearance: none; -webkit-appearance: none;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem; min-height: 40px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); color: var(--muted);
    border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;
  }
  .etude-ghost:hover { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--text); }

  /* === final === */
  .day-final {
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .day-final-text {
    margin: 0 0 0.55rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.55;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .day-final-prompt {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* === comparison === */
  .cmp-card[hidden] { display: none; }
  .cmp-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.95rem;
  }
  .cmp-col {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
  }
  .cmp-col-name {
    margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .cmp-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0; margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .cmp-list li {
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }
  .cmp-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .cmp-k {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .cmp-v { line-height: 1.45; }
  .cmp-bad  { color: var(--accent); }
  .cmp-good { color: #2d7a3e; }
  .cmp-note {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* === failure / coda === */
  .etude-failure { margin: 2.5rem 0 0; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .etude-failure-title {
    font-family: var(--serif-display); font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.005em; color: var(--text);
  }
  .etude-failure p { margin: 0 0 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text); }

  .etude-coda { margin: 2rem 0 0; padding-top: 1.25rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .etude-coda p { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 32rem) {
    .etude-title { font-size: 1.85rem; }
    .etude-card { padding: 1.15rem 1.1rem 1rem; border-radius: 10px; }
    .day-card { padding: 1.1rem 1.05rem 1rem; }
    .role-toggle { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .day-meters { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.6rem; }
    .feed-item { grid-template-columns: 3.6rem 1rem 1fr; gap: 0.4rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem; font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .cmp-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
